#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:2
msgid "Review Git Changes"
msgstr "审查 Git 变更"

#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:4
msgid ""
"Studio does not replace Git, but it makes the current workspace state "
"easier to inspect and use as context for a conversation."
msgstr "Studio 不会替代 Git，但会让当前工作区状态更容易检查，也更容易作为对话上下文使用。"

#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:8
msgid "Open the Changes panel"
msgstr "打开 Changes 面板"

#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:10
msgid "Select a Git workspace."
msgstr "选择 Git 工作区。"

#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:11
msgid "Open a **Changes** panel from the dock or from a session summary."
msgstr "从停靠区或会话摘要打开 **Changes** 面板。"

#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:12
msgid "Choose the source folder when the workspace contains more than one."
msgstr "工作区包含多个源文件夹时，选择源文件夹。"

#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:13
msgid "Refresh the diff after an agent run or after an external Git operation."
msgstr "agent 运行或外部 Git 操作后刷新 diff。"

#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:15
msgid ""
"The panel shows changed files and additions/deletions. Small text diffs "
"load first. Large files stay collapsed or may be truncated so that the "
"review panel remains responsive; open a file directly when you need more "
"context."
msgstr "面板会显示变更文件以及新增/删除内容。小型文本 diff 会优先加载。大文件会保持折叠或可能被截断，以便审查面板保持响应；需要更多上下文时，请直接打开文件。"

#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:20
msgid "Request a change on a line"
msgstr "请求修改某一行"

#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:22
msgid ""
"In a diff, select the line that needs work and choose **Request changes "
"on this line**. Write what should change and add the comment. Studio "
"attaches the review comment to the next request so the agent can act on a"
" precise location."
msgstr "在 diff 中选择需要处理的行，然后选择 **Request changes on this line**。写明应如何修改并添加评论。Studio 会将审查评论附加到下一条请求，让 agent 可以针对精确位置采取行动。"

#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:26
msgid "This is useful for review language such as:"
msgstr "这适合使用如下审查表述："

#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:28
msgid "“Keep this public method compatible with existing callers.”"
msgstr "“保持此公共方法与现有调用方兼容。”"

#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:29
msgid "“Add a test for the empty-array case.”"
msgstr "“为数组为空的情况添加测试。”"

#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:30
msgid "“This file is unrelated to the task; revert it.”"
msgstr "“这个文件与任务无关；请还原它。”"

#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:33
msgid "Branches"
msgstr "分支"

#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:35
msgid ""
"Use the branch action to search existing branches and check one out, or "
"use **Create & Checkout** to create a new branch. If the working tree has"
" changes, Studio asks whether to commit them before switching. Read the "
"changed-file summary before committing."
msgstr "使用分支操作搜索现有分支并切换到其中一个，或使用 **Create & Checkout** 创建并切换到新分支。如果工作树有变更，Studio 会询问是否在切换前提交。提交前请阅读变更文件摘要。"

#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:41
msgid "Commit and push"
msgstr "提交和推送"

#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:43
msgid "The **Commit or push** action can:"
msgstr "**Commit or push** 操作可以："

#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:45
msgid "commit the selected workspace changes;"
msgstr "提交选定的工作区变更；"

#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:46
msgid "push changes to the configured remote;"
msgstr "将变更推送到已配置的远程仓库；"

#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:47
msgid "commit and push in one action."
msgstr "在一次操作中完成提交和推送。"

#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:49
msgid ""
"You can enter a commit message or let the configured Git commit model "
"draft one from the diff. Treat a generated message as a draft: check that"
" it says what actually changed. Pushing is an external repository action,"
" so review the branch, files, remote, and approval prompt before "
"confirming."
msgstr "你可以输入提交消息，也可以让已配置的 Git 提交模型根据 diff 起草消息。请将生成的消息视为草稿，检查它是否准确描述了实际变更。推送属于外部仓库操作，因此确认前请审查分支、文件、远程仓库和审批提示。"

#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:55
msgid "Good Git habits"
msgstr "良好的 Git 习惯"

#: ../../source/tools/git.rst:57
msgid ""
"Create a branch before a risky experiment, inspect the diff after every "
"agent-written batch, and commit only a coherent state. Git is your "
"recovery path when a Goal or manual edit does not produce the result you "
"wanted."
msgstr "进行高风险实验前创建分支，每批 agent 写入后检查 diff，并且只提交完整一致的状态。当 Goal 或手动编辑没有产生预期结果时，Git 是你的恢复路径。"
